[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Load the modules in the main context of nginx.conf, in this order:

load_module /usr/local/libexec/nginx/ndk_http_module.so;
load_module /usr/local/libexec/nginx/ngx_http_lua_module.so;

The Lua of nginx is LuaJIT (lang/luajit-openresty); its modules (lua51-*)
are in /usr/local/share/lua/5.1 and /usr/local/lib/lua/5.1.
EOM
}
